MTP speculative decoding with pipeline parallelism on vLLM 0.27.1.

Backport of vLLM PR #46994 (MTP + PP on the V2 model runner), plus the Qwen3.5
hybrid-Mamba fixes needed to actually run it:
- index_fill_ indices cast to int64 in mamba_hybrid.py (PP long prefill crashed
  with the default int32 indices),
- the draft (MTP) module instantiated on the last PP rank with its
  intermediate-tensor plumbing,
- pp_utils/autoregressive-speculator support for the extra PP broadcasts.

Path layout matches every other patch here: apply from the vllm package dir,
  patch -p1 -d venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm < vllm-pr46994-mtp-pp.patch

